<section class="prayer-knowledge" aria-labelledby="prayer-knowledge-title" id="prayer-knowledge">
 <header>
  <h2 id="prayer-knowledge-title">Understanding the five daily prayer times</h2>
  <p>Find the time your prayer begins, understand why different mosques publish different timetables, and learn how the five windows relate to dawn, the Sun and twilight. This guide explains the calculator above rather than replacing your mosque's local timetable.</p>
 </header>
 <nav class="prayer-knowledge-nav" aria-label="Prayer times guide sections">
  <a href="#prayer-five-windows">Five prayer windows</a>
  <a href="#prayer-methods-explained">Calculation methods</a>
  <a href="#prayer-asr-differences">Asr differences</a>
